**<%= t("notifications.body.job_name") %>:** <%= job_run.job.name %>
**<%= t("notifications.body.job_id") %>:** <%= job_run.sequence %>
**<%= t("notifications.body.source") %>:** <%= job_run.job.source_repository.name %><%= " (#{I18n.t("jobs.table.on_server", server: job_run.job.source_repository.server.name)})" if job_run.job.source_repository.server.present? %>
**<%= t("notifications.body.destination") %>:** <%= job_run.job.destination_repository.name %><%= " (#{I18n.t("jobs.table.on_server", server: job_run.job.destination_repository.server.name)})" if job_run.job.destination_repository.server.present? %>
**<%= t("notifications.body.started_at") %>:** <%= l(job_run.started_at, format: :long) %>
**<%= t("notifications.body.trigger") %>:** <%= job_run.trigger %>
**<%= t("notifications.body.triggered_by") %>:** <%= job_run.user.email %>
